replacement therapy (HRT) with estrogen and
progesterone in a 55-year-old
postmenopausal woman?','{"A":"If used longer than 5 years, it\nSignificantly increases the risk of\nbreast cancer.","B":"It is not recommended for treating\npostmenopausal women\npresenting with osteoporosis who\nare older than 60 to 65 years and\nwhere the management of\nosteoporosis is the only concern.","C":"It should be avoided in patient with\nhistory of deep vein thrombosis.","D":"Combination with alendronate is\nusually discouraged.","E":"In women who are more than\nthree years post menopausal,\nraloxifene is effective in reducing\n\nvertebral fracture risk. ©"}',NULL,NULL,'{"source_relative_path":"AMEDEX 2025.09更新包/AMEDEX 2025 GYNAECOLOGY (4).pdf","supporting_pages":[],"source_qid":null,"duplicate_group_id":"exact-59613cb78b15","duplicate_sources":[{"record_id":"97a94d88b6ee19f0ca33","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"AMEDEX 2025 GYNAECOLOGY (4).pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX 2025.09更新包/AMEDEX 2025 GYNAECOLOGY (4).pdf","source_page":16,"source_qid":null},{"record_id":"ec3a2b2e5324bc16df5b","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"AMEDEX 2025 GYNAECOLOGY (4).pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX 2025.09更新包/AMEDEX 2025 GYNAECOLOGY (4).pdf","source_page":17,"source_qid":null}],"parser_version":"2.7.1-parser-only-conservative-staging-2026-09-22","parser_mode":"strict_ocr_tolerant","text_method":"tesseract_retry_200dpi_psm3","visual_asset":null,"asset_preview_url":null}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'needs_verification','[]','medium','{"record_id":"97a94d88b6ee19f0ca33","source_file":"AMEDEX 2025 GYNAECOLOGY (4).pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX 2025.09更新包/AMEDEX 2025 GYNAECOLOGY (4).pdf","source_year":2025,"source_page":16,"source_qid":null,"domain_hint":"Gynaecology","stem":"Which of the following statements is incorrect\nregarding the use of combined hormone\nreplacement therapy (HRT) with estrogen and\nprogesterone in a 55-year-old\npostmenopausal woman?","options":{"A":"If used longer than 5 years, it\nSignificantly increases the risk of\nbreast cancer.","B"