pills (Microgynon 30®) presents to your clinic
for a repeat prescription. On examination,
you find out that she has a blood pressure of
160/100mmHg, confirmed by a second
reading 20 minutes later. She mentions that
She and her husband have plans to start a
family in six months. Which one of the
following is the best advice for her?','{"A":"She can continue the same OCP\nbut should use methyldopa for\nhypertension.","B":"She should change to an OCP\npreparation with lower dose of\nestrogen.","C":"She should stop OCP, use condoms\nfor contraception, and reassess her\nblood pressure in three months.","D":"She should stop the OCP and be\nStarted on methyldopa for\nhypertension.","E":"She should stop the OCP and b\nStarted on a diuretic or ACE ©\ninhibitor for hypertension."}',NULL,NULL,'{"source_relative_path":"AMEDEX 2025.09更新包/AMEDEX 2025 GYNAECOLOGY (5).pdf","supporting_pages":[],"source_qid":null,"duplicate_group_id":"exact-47065ef66c38","duplicate_sources":[{"record_id":"9fcf4c16bcfbb28e1b71","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"AMEDEX 2025 GYNAECOLOGY (5).pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX 2025.09更新包/AMEDEX 2025 GYNAECOLOGY (5).pdf","source_page":73,"source_qid":null}],"parser_version":"2.8.1-residual-resolver-checkpoint-resume-2026-09-23","parser_mode":"v28_selective_ocr_base_parser","text_method":"v28_selective_ocr","visual_asset":null,"asset_preview_url":null}',NULL,NULL,'text',NULL,'needs_verification','[]','low','{"record_id":"9fcf4c16bcfbb28e1b71","source_file":"AMEDEX 2025 GYNAECOLOGY (5).pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX 2025.09更新包/AMEDEX 2025 GYNAECOLOGY (5).pdf","source_year":2025,"source_page":73,"source_qid":null,"domain_hint":"Gynaecology","stem":"oD\npills (Microgynon 30®) presents to your clinic\nfor a repeat prescription. On examination,\nyou find out that she has a blood pressure of\n160/100mmHg, confirmed by a second\nreading 20 minutes later. She mentions that\nShe and her husband have plans to start a\nfamily in six months. Which one of the\nfollowing is the best advice for her?","options":{"A":"She can continue the same OCP\nbut should use methyldopa for\nhypertension.","B":"She should change to an OCP\npreparation with lower dose of\nestrogen.","C":"She should stop OCP, use condoms\nfor contraception, and reassess her\nblood pressure in three months.","D":"She should stop the OCP and be\nStarted on methyldopa for\nhypertension.","E":"She should stop the OCP and b\nStarted on a diuretic or ACE ©\ninhibitor for hypertension."},"source_answer":null,"source_explanation":null,"source_answer_status":"pending_import","current_answer":null,"current_answer_status":"needs_verification","current_evidence":[],"currentness_risk":"low","currentness_keywords":[],"likely_visual_question":false,"parser_confidence":"high","parser_mode":"v28_selective_ocr_base_parser","text_method":"v28_selective_ocr","record_type":"text_mcq","options_mode":"text","parser_version":"2.8.1-residual-resolver-checkpoint-resume-2026-09-23","stem_hash":"47065ef66c3829c1774772c0890b1eb5539f5ba0","duplicate_group_id":"exact-47065ef66c38","duplicate_sources":[{"record_id":"9fcf4c16bcfbb28e1b71","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"AMEDEX 2025 GYNAECOLOGY (5).pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX 2025.09更新包/AMEDEX 2025 GYNAECOLOGY (5).pdf","source_page":73,"source_qid":null}]}',0,'v2.9.4','2026-09-24T00:00:00.000Z') ON CONFLICT(record_id) DO UPDATE SET source_file=excluded.source_file,source_page=excluded.source_page,domain=excluded.domain,stem=excluded.stem,options_json=excluded.options_json,source_answer=excluded.source_answer,source_explanation=excluded.source_explanation,provenance_json=excluded.provenance_json,visual_asset=excluded.visual_asset,visual_url=excluded.visual_url,options_mode=excluded.options_mode,current_answer=excluded.current_answer,current_answer_status=excluded.current_answer_status,current_evidence_json=excluded.current_evidence_json,currentness_risk=excluded.currentness_risk,record_json=excluded.record_json,active_quiz=excluded.active_quiz,import_version=excluded.import_version,imported_at=excluded.imported_at;
