Screening at your clinic one year ago, which
was reported as low-grade squamous
intraepithelial lesion (LSIL). You repeat the
test after 12 months reporting the same
result. Which one of the following would be
the next best step in management?','{"A":"Refer for colposcopy.","B":"Repeat the cervical screening in 12\nmonths again.","C":"Perform cervical screening every\n3 months.","D":"Advise the patient for safe sex\npractices to reduce the risk of\ncervical cancer.","E":"No action is required."}',NULL,NULL,'{"source_relative_path":"AMEDEX 2025.09更新包/AMEDEX 2025 GYNAECOLOGY (5).pdf","supporting_pages":[76],"source_qid":null,"duplicate_group_id":"exact-86c9b775fb07","duplicate_sources":[{"record_id":"60b246f229cfb31290b9","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"AMEDEX 2025 GYNAECOLOGY (5).pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX 2025.09更新包/AMEDEX 2025 GYNAECOLOGY (5).pdf","source_page":76,"source_qid":null},{"record_id":"5d04f507b2f700dd1acb","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"Obstetrics and Gynaecology Amedex 2025.pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX2025+redbook+handbook图片题/Obstetrics and Gynaecology Amedex 2025.pdf","source_page":424,"source_qid":null},{"record_id":"8ff99f07ded276de5b6e","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"Amedex 2023.pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX2025+redbook+handbook图片题/Amedex 2023.pdf","source_page":1110,"source_qid":"420"}],"parser_version":"2.7.1-parser-only-conservative-staging-2026-09-22","parser_mode":"v27_same_page_five_structural","text_method":"tesseract_retry_200dpi_psm3","visual_asset":null,"asset_preview_url":null}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'needs_verification','[]','high','{"record_id":"60b246f229cfb31290b9","source_file":"AMEDEX 2025 GYNAECOLOGY (5).pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX 2025.09更新包/AMEDEX 2025 GYNAECOLOGY (5).pdf","source_year":2025,"source_page":76,"supporting_pages":[76],"source_qid":null,"domain_hint":"Gynaecology","stem":"A 35-year-old woman had a cervical\nScreening at your clinic one year ago, which\nwas reported as low-grade squamous\nintraepithelial lesion (LSIL). You repeat the\ntest after 12 months reporting the same\nresult. Which one of the following would be\nthe next best step in management?","options":{"A":"