department with a fracture of the right
femoral neck after he sustained a fall at
home. He underwent coronary artery drug-
eluting stent placement two months ago
and has been on clopidogrel since then. A full
blood count (FBC) is normal; however, he has
several bruises over his body. He requires
surgery for the fixation of the fracture. Which
one of the following is the most appropriate
management of this patient?','{"A":"Stop clopidogrel and proceed with\nthe surgery in one week.","B":"Do the surgery now.","C":"G Administer fresh frozen (FFP)\nplasma and proceed with the\nsurgery.","D":"Give platelets and proceed with the\nsurgery.","E":"Switch to heparin and perform the\nSurgery in seven days."}',NULL,NULL,'{"source_relative_path":"AMEDEX 2025.09更新包/AMEDEX 2025 HEMAETOLOGY (2).pdf","supporting_pages":[],"source_qid":null,"duplicate_group_id":"exact-c46a29370f08","duplicate_sources":[{"record_id":"531eea2b278afcc6b36d","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"AMEDEX 2025 HEMAETOLOGY (2).pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX 2025.09更新包/AMEDEX 2025 HEMAETOLOGY (2).pdf","source_page":62,"source_qid":null}],"parser_version":"2.7.1-parser-only-conservative-staging-2026-09-22","parser_mode":"five_block_inferred","text_method":"tesseract_retry_200dpi_psm3","visual_asset":null,"asset_preview_url":null}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'needs_verification','[]','high','{"record_id":"531eea2b278afcc6b36d","source_file":"AMEDEX 2025 HEMAETOLOGY (2).pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX 2025.09更新包/AMEDEX 2025 HEMAETOLOGY (2).pdf","source_year":2025,"source_page":62,"source_qid":null,"domain_hint":"Mixed/Unclassified","stem":"A 73-year-old man presents to the emergency\ndepartment with a fracture of the right\nfemoral neck after he sustained a fall at\nhome. He underwent coronary artery drug-\neluting stent placement two months ago\nand has been on clopidogrel since then. A full\nblood count (FBC) is normal; however, he has\nseveral bruises over his body. He requires\nsurgery for the fixation of the fracture. Which\none of the following is the most appropriate\nmanagement of this patient?","options":{"A":"Stop clopidogrel and proceed with\nthe surgery in one week.","B":"Do the surgery now.","C":"G Administer fresh frozen (FFP)\nplasma and proceed with the\nsurgery.","D":"Give platelets and proceed with the\nsurgery.","E":"Switch to heparin and perform the\nSurgery in seven day